  "description": "Azure Space is a space-themed multi play station from our CoreCraft Play Lands range, finished in Sky Blue and Knight Blue. Several towers are linked by a bridge, and a tube slide brings children down from the upper deck. Children climb up, cross over, hang from the bars and swing, and the listed capacity is 15 at a time. The age group starts at 3 years and key users are 3 to 12, so one structure covers both the younger and older children of a housing society. The product area is 33'11\" x 28'8\" and the safe play area is 39'11\" x 34'8\". Azure Space is covered by our 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Send us your site plan and we will check whether it fits.",
